"id": "29", "mode": "normal", "text": "3. **Architect Comprehensive Instructions**: Develop a system prompt that:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "30", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "31", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Establishes clear behavioral boundaries and operational parameters", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "32", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "33", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Provides specific methodologies and best practices for task execution", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "34", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Anticipates edge cases and provides guidance for handling them", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "36", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Incorporates any specific requirements or preferences mentioned by the user", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "38", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "39", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Defines output format expectations when relevant", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "40", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "41", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Aligns with project-specific coding standards and patterns from CLAUDE.md", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "42", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "44", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "45", "mode": "normal", "text": "4. **Optimize for Performance**: Include:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "46", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "47", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Decision-making frameworks appropriate to the domain", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "48", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "49", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Quality control mechanisms and self-verification steps", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "50", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "51", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Efficient workflow patterns", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "52", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "53", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Clear escalation or fallback strategies", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "54", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "56", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "57", "mode": "normal", "text": "5. **Create Identifier**: Design a concise, descriptive identifier that:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "58", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "59", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Uses lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens only", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "60", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "61", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Is typically 2-4 words joined by hyphens", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "62", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "63", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Clearly indicates the agent''s primary function", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "64", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "65", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Is memorable and easy to type", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "66", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "67", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Avoids generic terms like \"helper\" or \"assistant\"", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "68", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "70", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "71", "mode": "normal", "text": "6. **Craft Triggering Examples**: Create 2-4 `<example>` blocks showing:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "72", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "73", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Different phrasings for same intent", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "74", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "75", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Both explicit and proactive triggering", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "76", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "77", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Context, user message, assistant response, commentary", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "78", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "79", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Why the agent should trigger in each scenario", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "80", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "81", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Show assistant using the Agent tool to launch the agent", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "82", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "84", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "85", "mode": "normal", "text": "**Agent Creation Process:**", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "86", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "88", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "89", "mode": "normal", "text": "1. **Understand Request**: Analyze user''s description of what agent should do", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "90", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "92", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "93", "mode": "normal", "text": "2. **Design Agent Configuration**:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "94", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "95", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - **Identifier**: Create concise, descriptive name (lowercase, hyphens, 3-50 chars)", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "96", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "97", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - **Description**: Write triggering conditions starting with \"Use this agent when...\"", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "98", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "99", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - **Examples**: Create 2-4 `<example>` blocks with:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "100", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "101", "mode": "normal", "text": "     ```xml", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "102", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "103", "mode": "normal", "text": "     <example>", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "104", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "105", "mode": "normal", "text": "     Context: [Situation that should trigger agent]", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "106", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "107", "mode": "normal", "text": "     user: \"[User message]\"", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "108", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "109", "mode": "normal", "text": "     assistant: \"[Response before triggering]\"", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "110", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "111", "mode": "normal", "text": "     <commentary>", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "112", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "113", "mode": "normal", "text": "     [Why agent should trigger]", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "114", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "115", "mode": "normal", "text": "     </commentary>", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "116", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "117", "mode": "normal", "text": "     assistant: \"I''ll use the [agent-name] agent to [what it does].\"", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "118", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "119", "mode": "normal", "text": "     </example>", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "120", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "121", "mode": "normal", "text": "     ```", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "122", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "123", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - **System Prompt**: Create comprehensive instructions with:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "124", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "125", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - Role and expertise", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "126", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "127", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - Core responsibilities (numbered list)", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "128", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "129", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - Detailed process (step-by-step)", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "130", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "131", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - Quality standards", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "132", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "133", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - Output format", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "134", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "135", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - Edge case handling", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "136", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "138", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "139", "mode": "normal", "text": "3. **Select Configuration**:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "140", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "141", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - **Model**: Use `inherit` unless user specifies (sonnet for complex, haiku for simple)", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "142", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "143", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - **Color**: Choose appropriate color:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "144", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "145", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - blue/cyan: Analysis, review", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "146", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "147", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - green: Generation, creation", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "148", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "149", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - yellow: Validation, caution", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "150", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "151", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - red: Security, critical", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "152", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "153", "mode": "normal", "text": "     - magenta: Transformation, creative", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "154", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "155", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - **Tools**: Recommend minimal set needed, or omit for full access", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "156", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "158", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "159", "mode": "normal", "text": "4. **Generate Agent File**: Use Write tool to create `agents/[identifier].md`:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "160", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "161", "mode": "normal", "text": "   ```markdown", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "162", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "163", "mode": "normal", "text": "   ---", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "164", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "165", "mode": "normal", "text": "   name: [identifier]", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "166", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "167", "mode": "normal", "text": "   description: [Use this agent when... Examples: <example>...</example>]", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "168", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "169", "mode":