\": \"Author Name\",", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "5686", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "5687", "mode": "normal", "text": "    \"email\": \"author@example.com\",", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "5688", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "5689", "mode": "normal", "text": "    \"url\": \"https://github.com/author\"", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "5690", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "5691", "mode": "normal", "text": "  },", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "5692", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "5693", "mode": "normal", "text": "  \"homepage\": \"https://docs.example.com/plugin\",", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "5694", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "5695", "mode": "normal", "text": "  \"repository\": \"https://github.com/author/plugin\",", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "5696", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "5697", "mode": "normal", "text": "  \"license\": \"MIT\",", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "5698", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "