"version": 1, "children": [{"id": "1812", "mode": "normal", "text": "1. **Discover files**: Use `Glob` to find all `*.{js,mjs,cjs,ts,tsx,jsx,html,htm,css,scss,sass,less,styl}`", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "1813", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "1815", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "1816", "mode": "normal", "text": "2. **JavaScript Analysis** (per file):", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "1817", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "1818", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Read file content", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "1819", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "1820", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Check for undefined variables by tracking declarations vs usage", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "1821", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "1822", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Verify all imports have corresponding usage", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "1823", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "1824", "mode": "normal", "text": "   - Check for syntax patterns (missing braces, parentheses)", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "1825",