en": [{"id": "2300", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "2302", "mode": "normal", "text": "E. UI/UX Design System", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2587", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2304", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2306", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2305", "mode": "normal", "text": "Create comprehensive design system:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2588", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2307", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2310", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2308", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Color palette with accessibility contrast ratios", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2313", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2311", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Typography scale and usage guidelines", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2316", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2314", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Icon library and custom iconography needs", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2319", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2317", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Component library for all UI elements", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2322", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2320", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Interaction patterns for common tasks", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2325", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2323", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Animation language and micro interaction specifications", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2328", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2326", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Responsive behavior across device sizes", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2331", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2329", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Dark mode implementation strategy", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2589", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2332", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2336", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2333", "mode": "normal", "text": "**Design 5 8 key screens at high fidelity, showing complete user flows for critical journeys. Specify empty states, loading states, error states, and success states.**", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"id": "2590", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2337", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2341", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2338", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "2340", "mode": "normal", "text": "F. Development Roadmap & Resource Planning", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2591", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2342", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2344", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2343", "mode": "normal", "text": "Break down implementation into two week sprints for first 3 months. Each sprint must contain:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2592", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2345", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2348", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2346", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Specific features and user stories", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2351", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2349", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Technical tasks with effort estimates in person days", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2354", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2352", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Dependencies and blockers", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2357", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2355", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Definition of done criteria", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2360", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2358", "mode": "normal", "text": "- QA and testing scope", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2593", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2361", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2365", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2362", "mode": "normal", "text": "**Specify team composition needed: iOS developers, Android developers, backend engineers, frontend engineers, QA engineers, DevOps engineer, product designer, product manager. Provide hiring timeline if building team from scratch.**", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"id": "2594", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2366", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2370", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2367", "mode": "normal", "text": "**Create detailed budget breakdown: development costs, design costs, infrastructure costs, third party service subscriptions, App Store fees, marketing budget, contingency buffer.**", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"id": "2595", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2371", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2375", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2372", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "2374", "mode": "normal", "text": "G. Risk Assessment & Mitigation", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2596", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2376", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2378", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2377", "mode": "normal", "text": "Identify technical risks (technology immaturity, scaling bottlenecks, security vulnerabilities), business risks (competitive response, market shift, regulatory changes), and execution risks (team turnover, budget overrun, timeline delays). For each risk, assign probability and impact score, then design specific mitigation strategies with trigger points for activation.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2597", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2379", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2383", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2380", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "2382", "mode": "normal", "text": "H. Monetization & Business Model", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2598", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2384", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2386", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2385", "mode": "normal", "text": "If applicable, design complete monetization strategy:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2599", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2387", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2390", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2388", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Pricing tiers and feature differentiation", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2393", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2391", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Payment gateway integration (Stripe, Apple Pay, Google Pay)", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2396", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2394", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Subscription management and billing logic", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2399", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2397", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Trial period and conversion optimization", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2402", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2400", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Lifetime value and customer acquisition cost modeling", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2405", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2403", "mode": "normal", "text": "- Retention and churn reduction tactics", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2600", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2406", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2410", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2407", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "2409", "mode": "normal", "text": "I. Launch Strategy & User Acquisition", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2601", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2411", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "2413", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "2412", "mode": "normal", "text": "Create phased launch plan: beta testing with 100 users, soft launch in single market, full public launch. Specify launch timeline with pre launch activities (landing page, waitlist building, content marketing), launch day activities (Product Hunt, press outreach,