 {"id": "25257", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25259", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25260", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### Project-level hooks for subagent events", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25261", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25263", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25264", "mode": "normal", "text": "Configure hooks in `settings.json` that respond to subagent lifecycle events in the main session.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25265", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25267", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25268", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| Event           | Matcher input   | When it fires                    |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25269", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25271", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25272", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| :-------------- | :-------------- | :------------------------------- |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25273", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25275", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25276", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `SubagentStart` | Agent type name | When a subagent begins execution |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25277", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25279", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25280", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `SubagentStop`  | Agent type name | When a subagent completes        |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25281", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25283", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25284", "mode": "normal", "text": "Both events support matchers to target specific agent types by name. This example runs a setup script only when the `db-agent` subagent starts, and a cleanup script when any subagent stops:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25285", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25287", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25288", "mode": "normal", "text": "```json theme={null} ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25289", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25291", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25292", "mode": "normal", "text": "{ ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25293", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25295", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25296", "mode": "normal", "text": "  \"hooks\": { ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25297", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25299", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25300", "mode": "normal", "text": "    \"SubagentStart\": [ ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25301", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25303", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25304", "mode": "normal", "text": "      { ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25305", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "25307", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "25308", "mode": "normal", "text": "        \"matcher\": \"db-agent\", ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "versio