": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35517", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35518", "mode": "normal", "text": "} ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35519", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35521", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35522", "mode": "normal", "text": "```", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35523", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35525", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35526", "mode": "normal", "text": "### Hook handler fields", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35527", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35529", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35530", "mode": "normal", "text": "Each object in the inner `hooks` array is a hook handler: the shell command, LLM prompt, or agent that runs when the matcher matches. There are three types:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35531", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35533", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35534", "mode": "normal", "text": "- **[Command hooks](#command-hook-fields)** (`type: \"command\"`): run a shell command. Your script receives the event''s [JSON input](#hook-input-and-output) on stdin and communicates results back through exit codes and stdout.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35535", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35537", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35538", "mode": "normal", "text": "- **[Prompt hooks](#prompt-and-agent-hook-fields)** (`type: \"prompt\"`): send a prompt to a Claude model for single-turn evaluation. The model returns a yes/no decision as JSON. See [Prompt-based hooks](#prompt-based-hooks).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35539", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35541", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35542", "mode": "normal", "text": "- **[Agent hooks](#prompt-and-agent-hook-fields)** (`type: \"agent\"`): spawn a subagent that can use tools like Read, Grep, and Glob to verify conditions before returning a decision. See [Agent-based hooks](#agent-based-hooks).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35543", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35545", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35546", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### Common fields", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35547", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35549", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35550", "mode": "normal", "text": "These fields apply to all hook types:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35551", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35553", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35554", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| Field           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                   |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35555", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35557", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35558", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| :-------------- | :------- | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35559", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35561", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35562", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `type`          | yes      | `\"command\"`, `\"prompt\"`, or `\"agent\"`                                                                                                         |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35563", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35565", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35566", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `timeout`       | no       | Seconds before canceling. Defaults: 600 for command, 30 for prompt, 60 for agent                                                              |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35567", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35569", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35570", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `statusMessage` | no       | Custom spinner message displayed while the hook runs                                                                                          |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35571", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35573", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35574", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `once`          | no       | If `true`, runs only once per session then is removed. Skills only, not agents. See [Hooks in skills and agents](#hooks-in-skills-and-agents) |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35575", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35577", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35578", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### Command hook fields", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35579", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35581", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35582", "mode": "normal", "text": "In addition to the [common fields](#common-fields), command hooks accept these fields:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35583", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35585", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35586", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| Field     | Required | Description                                                                                                         |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35587", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35589", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35590", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| :-------- | :------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35591", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35593", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35594", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `command` | yes      | Shell command to execute                                                                                            |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35595", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35597", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35598", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `async`   | no       | If `true`, runs in the background without blocking. See [Run hooks in the background](#run-hooks-in-the-background) |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35599", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35601", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35602", "mode": "normal", "text": "#### Prompt and agent hook fields", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35603", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35605", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35606", "mode": "normal", "text": "In addition to the [common fields](#common-fields), prompt and agent hooks accept these fields:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35607", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35609", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35610", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| Field    | Required | Description                                                                                 |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35611", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35613", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35614", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| :------- | :------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35615", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35617", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35618", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `prompt` | yes      | Prompt text to send to the model. Use `$ARGUMENTS` as a placeholder for the hook input JSON |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35619", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35621", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35622", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `model`  | no       | Model to use for evaluation. Defaults to a fast model                                       |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35623", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35625", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35626", "mode": "normal", "text": "All matching hooks run in parallel, and identical handlers are deduplicated automatically. Handlers run in the current directory with Claude Code''s environment. The `$CLAUDE_CODE_REMOTE` environment variable is set to `\"true\"` in remote web environments and not set in the local CLI.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35627", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35629", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35630", "mode": "normal", "text": "### Reference scripts by path", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35631", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35633", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35634", "mode": "normal", "text": "Use environment variables to reference hook scripts relative to the project or plugin root, regardless of the working directory when the hook runs:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35635", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35637", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35638", "mode": "normal", "text": "- `$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR`: the project root. Wrap in quotes to handle paths with spaces.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35639", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35641", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35642", "mode": "normal", "text": "- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}`: the plugin''s root directory, for scripts bundled with a [plugin](/en/plugins).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35643", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35645", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35646", "mode": "normal", "text": "<Tabs>", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35647", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35649", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35650", "mode": "normal", "text": "  <Tab title=\"Project scripts\">", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35651", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35653", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35654", "mode": "normal", "text": "````", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35655", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35656", "mode": "normal", "text": "This example uses `$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR` to run a style checker from the project''s `.claude/hooks/` directory after any `Write` or `Edit` tool call: ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35657", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35659", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35661", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35663", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35664", "mode": "normal", "text": "```json  theme={null} ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35665", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35667", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35668", "mode": "normal", "text": "{ ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35669", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35671", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "vers