omponents reference](/en/plugins-reference#hooks) for details on creating plugin hooks. ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35841", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35842", "mode": "normal", "text": "````", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35843", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35845", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35846", "mode": "normal", "text": "  </Tab>", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35847", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35849", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35850", "mode": "normal", "text": "</Tabs>", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35851", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35853", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35854", "mode": "normal", "text": "### Hooks in skills and agents", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35855", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35857", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35858", "mode": "normal", "text": "In addition to settings files and plugins, hooks can be defined directly in [skills](/en/skills) and [subagents](/en/sub-agents) using frontmatter. These hooks are scoped to the component''s lifecycle and only run when that component is active.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35859", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35861", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35862", "mode": "normal", "text": "All hook events are supported. For subagents, `Stop` hooks are automatically converted to `SubagentStop` since that is the event that fires when a subagent completes.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35863", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35865", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35866", "mode": "normal", "text": "Hooks use the same configuration format as settings-based hooks but are scoped to the component''s lifetime and cleaned up when it finishes.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35867", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "35869", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "35870", "mode": "normal", "text": "This skill defines a `PreToolUse` hook that runs a security validation script before each `Bash` command:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "d