[{"id": "37454", "mode": "normal", "text": "`PermissionRequest` hooks can allow or deny permission requests. In addition to the [JSON output fields](#json-output) available to all hooks, your hook script can return a `decision` object with these event-specific fields:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37455", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37457", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37458", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| Field                | Description                                                                                                    |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37459", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37461", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37462", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| :------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37463", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37465", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37466", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `behavior`           | `\"allow\"` grants the permission, `\"deny\"` denies it                                                            |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37467", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37469", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37470", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `updatedInput`       | For `\"allow\"` only: modifies the tool''s input parameters before execution                                      |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37471", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37473", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37474", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `updatedPermissions` | For `\"allow\"` only: applies permission rule updates, equivalent to the user selecting an \"always allow\" option |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37475", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37477", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37478", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `message`            | For `\"deny\"` only: tells Claude why the permission was denied                                                  |", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37479", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "37481", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "37482", "mode": "normal", "text": "\\| `interrupt`