{"id": "5379", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5380", "mode": "normal", "text": "```sh", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5381", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5382", "mode": "normal", "text": "cd /usr/ports/databases/pgvector", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5383", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5384", "mode": "normal", "text": "make install", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5385", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5386", "mode": "normal", "text": "```", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5387", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5388", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5389", "mode": "normal", "text": "### APK", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5390", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5391", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5392", "mode": "normal", "text": "Install the Alpine package with:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5393", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5394", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5395", "mode": "normal", "text": "```sh", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5396", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5397", "mode": "normal", "text": "apk add postgresql-pgvector", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5398", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5399", "mode": "normal", "text": "```", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5400", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5401", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5402", "mode": "normal", "text": "### conda-forge", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5403", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5404", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5405", "mode": "normal", "text": "With Conda Postgres, install from [conda-forge](https://anaconda.org/conda-forge/pgvector) with:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5406", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5407", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5408", "mode": "normal", "text": "```sh", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5409", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5410", "mode": "normal", "text": "conda install -c conda-forge pgvector", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5411", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5412", "mode": "normal", "text": "```", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5413", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5414", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5415", "mode": "normal", "text": "This method is [community-maintained](https://github.com/conda-forge/pgvector-feedstock) by [@mmcauliffe](https://github.com/mmcauliffe)", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5416", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5417", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5418", "mode": "normal", "text": "### Postgres.app", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5419", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5420", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5421", "mode": "normal", "text": "Download the [latest release](https://postgresapp.com/downloads.html) with Postgres 15+.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5422", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5423", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5424", "mode": "normal", "text": "## Hosted Postgres", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5425", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5426", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5427", "mode": "normal", "text": "pgvector is available on [these providers](https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector/issues/54).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5428", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5429", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5430", "mode": "normal", "text": "## Upgrading", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5431", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5432", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5433", "mode": "normal", "text": "[Install](#installation) the latest version (use the same method as the original installation). Then in each database you want to upgrade, run:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5434", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5435", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5436", "mode": "normal", "text": "```sql", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5437", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5438", "mode": "normal", "text": "ALTER EXTENSION vector UPDATE;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5439", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5440", "mode": "normal", "text": "```", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5441", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5442", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5443", "mode": "normal", "text": "You can check the version in the current database with:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "5444", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5445", "type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"id": "5446", "mode": "normal", "text": "```sql", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 