**594.**  A person authorized by the Director of Criminal and Penal Prosecutions may sign a document required for the application of this chapter and certify true a copy of or extract from the document. The signature of that person may be affixed by means of an automatic device or in the form of an engraved, lithographed or printed facsimile.

