ent in respect of the back seat passengers of a vehicle.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"id": "11342", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "11343", "mode": "normal", "text": "659.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"id": "11344", "mode": "normal", "text": " The judge of the Provincial Court who held the office of president of the Transport Tribunal on 1 June 1982 shall retain, for himself or his widow, his rights to the pension of a chief judge.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"id": "11345", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "11346", "mode": "normal", "text": "661.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"id": "11347", "mode": "normal", "text": " (Amendment integrated into c. A-25, s. 1).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"id": "11348", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "11349", "mode": "normal", "text": "662.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"id": "11350", "mode": "normal", "text": " (Amendment integrated into c. A-25, s. 151).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"id": "11351", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "11352", "mode": "normal", "text": "663.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"id": "11353", "mode": "normal", "text": " (Amendment integrated into c. A-25, s. 195).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": 