raph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "884", "mode": "normal", "text": "A website is not a document. It is a series of micro-decisions made at 300 milliseconds per frame, by a human brain running on caffeine and impatience.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 2, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 2}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"id": "885", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "886", "mode": "normal", "text": "Every enhancement you propose must survive this filter: ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "887", "mode": "normal", "text": "\"Would a distracted human, on a mediocre phone connection, in 8 seconds, get it?\"", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "888", "type": "horizontalrule", "version": 1}, {"id": "889", "tag": "h2", "type": "heading", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "890", "mode": "normal", "text": "THE 20 COGNITIVE STEPS", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"id": "891", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "892", "mode": "normal", "text": "Execute these sequentially AND in parallel — some are lenses, some are scalpels, some are mirrors.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"id": "893", "type": "horizontalrule", "version": 1}, {"id": "894", "tag": "h3", "type": "heading", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "895", "mode": "normal", "text": "STEP 1 — THE STRANGER PROTOCOL 👁️", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"id": "896", "type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{