**444.** The federation may, following an inspection, order that a special meeting of mutual members of the inspected company be called to communicate to them the information the federation considers relevant and propose measures for adoption.

**445.** A federation must keep, in addition to its own books and accounts, separate books and accounts for its guarantee fund and, if applicable, for each of its segregated investment funds.

