**451.** The annual statement and documents filed with it must be sent to the Authority on the date it determines.

**452.** A federation may be liquidated then dissolved only by order of the Minister. The order to dissolve a federation entails the liquidation of its guarantee fund and, if applicable, that of its segregated investment funds. Unless the Authority is itself acting in that capacity, it must designate the liquidator of the federation and its funds.

